sequenceDiagram
    participant S as Script (evil.com)
    participant B as Browser
    participant N as bank.com

    S->>B: fetch("https://bank.com/account")
    B->>N: GET /account  (Cookie: session=…)
    Note over B,N: The request goes out!<br/>No SOP here.
    N-->>B: 200 OK, account details (HTML)
    Note over B: Bytes arrive in the browser!<br/>No SOP here either.
    B-->>S: ❌ response body withheld from script
    S->>B: Send the bytes to my server!
    B-->>S: nothing to send — script never had them
